  "id": "typical-antipsychotic",
  "term": "typical antipsychotic",
  "definition": "A typical antipsychotic is a type of antipsychotic medication described in contrast to atypical, newer antipsychotic drugs. In this source, typical antipsychotics are noted for potentially causing marked reduced saliva and related oral discomfort.",
